1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,250
5 words to never say in AI copywriting.

2
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:12,590
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say revolutionize, instead say change - because people

3
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:15,720
nobody believes revolution.

4
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:22,090
Don't say game-changer, instead say turns things around - cliche alerts.

5
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:27,550
Don't say in today's world, instead say right now - timeless.

6
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:33,320
Don't say empower, instead say help - empower is corporate noise.

7
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:38,730
Don't say delve, instead say dig into - nobody says delve.

8
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:43,730
Your AI copywriting does not have to sound like everyone else's.

9
00:00:43,910 --> 00:00:47,750
Comment 'SYS' and I will send you the full list.

10
00:00:47,930 --> 00:00:52,130
Make sure you follow - it only goes to followers.
